{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj43Ha4gWBpfgqNfHqN1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient oak door stands before you, weathered but resolute. Iron bands cross its face in patterns older than memory. A single keyhole glows faintly with amber light.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep resonance travels through the wood — a sound felt more than heard. The iron bands shift, symbols realigning. Tumblers older than language fall into place, one by one by one.*\n\n*Click.*\n\n*The door exhales centuries of stillness. Dust motes spiral in the light now spilling from the widening crack between door and frame.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond: a corridor of warm stone, lit by floating lanterns that ignite in sequence, each one waking the next, stretching into a depth that should not fit within any building you know.*\n\n*The air that greets you tastes of rain on hot earth, of ink, of something sweet and unnameable.*\n\n*You are welcome here.*\n\n*You were expected.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":219,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}